@startuml
!theme plain
title Verified Model Training + Post-Inference Cluster Labeling

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #19226D

rectangle "Raw trip streams\nroad frames + driver frames + telemetry" as Raw #EAF2FF
rectangle "Per-source outputs\nroad_context + driver_state + vehicle_state" as SourceOut #EAF2FF
rectangle "Windowed feature vectors\n1s / 3s / 5s windows" as Windows #FFF7EE

rectangle "Seed rules\nTTC thresholds\nlane drift\nharsh brake\ndistraction at speed" as Rules #FFFFFF
rectangle "Human verification\nreview high-impact / uncertain events" as Human #FFFFFF
rectangle "Training dataset\nverified labels + feature windows\nbalanced by scenario and trip" as Dataset #FFFFFF

rectangle "Baseline model\nGBDT / XGBoost / LightGBM\nfast and explainable" as Baseline #034EA2
rectangle "Temporal model\nTCN / GRU / Tiny Transformer\nmultimodal sequence risk" as Temporal #F37021
rectangle "Calibration\nisotonic / Platt scaling\nrisk probability -> severity" as Calibration #FFFFFF
rectangle "Evaluation\nPR-AUC, false alarm/hour\nrecall@critical risk\ntrip-level consistency" as Eval #FFFFFF
rectangle "Model registry\nversioned online risk detector" as Registry #EAF2FF

rectangle "Risk events + embeddings\npost-inference outputs" as RiskOutputs #EAF2FF
rectangle "Embedding + clustering\ngroup recurring risk patterns" as Cluster #FFFFFF
rectangle "LLM semantic labeling\n4B-8B model\nname completed clusters" as LLM #FFFFFF
rectangle "Analyst validation\nconfirm cluster semantics" as Analyst #FFFFFF
rectangle "Risk cluster catalog\nlabels for dashboard analytics" as Catalog #EAF2FF

Raw --> SourceOut
SourceOut --> Windows
Windows --> Rules
Rules --> Dataset : high precision seed labels
Human --> Dataset
Windows --> Human : uncertain samples
Dataset --> Baseline
Dataset --> Temporal
Baseline --> Calibration
Temporal --> Calibration
Calibration --> Eval
Eval --> Registry
Registry --> Windows : deploy online model

Registry --> RiskOutputs : online inference
RiskOutputs --> Cluster
Cluster --> LLM : summary + representatives
LLM --> Analyst
Analyst --> Catalog

note bottom of Rules
Rules are useful for bootstrapping and auditability.
They should not be the only final detector because
interaction cases grow combinatorially.
end note

note bottom of LLM
LLM acts only after clustering.
Cluster labels are analytics metadata,
not model-training labels.
end note

@enduml
